<title>UK: UK confirms BOI, Bristol &amp; West deal.</title>
<headline>UK confirms BOI, Bristol &amp; West deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Building Societies Commission (BSC) on Wednesday said it had confirmed the proposed transfer of the business of the Bristol &amp; West Building Society to a subsidiary of the Bank of Ireland.</p>
<p>The decision follows BSC confirmation proceedings.</p>
<p>Bank of Ireland bought the building society in a deal which valued it at 600 million stg. Both BOI shareholders and Bristol &amp; West members have voted in favour of the takeover.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
